WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.063 --> 00:00:15.292
The sandstorm hit the ship.

2
00:00:15.293 --> 00:00:17.665
Bot pressed a button.

3
00:00:17.666 --> 00:00:21.355
The spaceship dropped to the ground.

4
00:00:21.356 --> 00:00:29.227
Shloomp! A tent formed around it.

5
00:00:29.228 --> 00:00:32.822
"It's a safety tent," Bot said.

6
00:00:32.823 --> 00:00:37.047
"I didn't know we had that," Ringo said.

7
00:00:37.048 --> 00:00:41.368
Finally the sandstorm passed.

8
00:00:41.369 --> 00:00:55.453
Ringo wiped his head. "Whew!"

9
00:00:55.454 --> 00:01:12.174
They went back to Lucy's spaceship.

10
00:01:12.175 --> 00:01:16.758
"I don't see Lucy or PJ," Ringo said.

11
00:01:16.759 --> 00:01:20.809
"The sand here is deep," Bot said.

12
00:01:20.810 --> 00:01:24.885
Ringo gasped. "Oh no, Bot!

13
00:01:24.886 --> 00:01:28.657
They probably got buried in the sandstorm."

14
00:01:28.658 --> 00:01:30.990
Ringo fell to the ground.

15
00:01:30.991 --> 00:01:35.588
He started digging. "I'll save you, Lucy!"

16
00:01:35.589 --> 00:01:38.650
He found some leaves in the sand.

17
00:01:38.651 --> 00:01:43.033
But he didn't find Lucy.

18
00:01:43.034 --> 00:01:47.505
Bot scanned the ground.

19
00:01:47.506 --> 00:01:51.916
"I can't find Lucy or PJ," she said.

20
00:01:51.917 --> 00:01:54.628
"They must be buried deep."

21
00:01:54.629 --> 00:01:58.214
Ringo dug faster and faster.

22
00:01:58.215 --> 00:02:01.063
Tears rolled down his cheeks.

23
00:02:01.064 --> 00:02:03.726
"Come on, Bot," he called.

24
00:02:03.727 --> 00:02:07.868
"Help me dig. Hang on, Lucy!"

25
00:02:07.869 --> 00:02:11.422
Ringo heard laughing.

26
00:02:11.423 --> 00:02:15.064
"Bot, this isn't funny. Help me—"

27
00:02:15.065 --> 00:02:19.611
"What are you digging for, Tiny?" someone asked.

28
00:02:19.612 --> 00:02:23.488
It was Lucy!

